# Hosts that answer an automated check with 403 or a challenge page whatever
# the link's state. One regular expression per line. Each entry is a link the
# weekly check cannot see, so add a host only after it has failed that way.
^https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*medium\.com/
^https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*apa\.org/
^https?://journals\.sagepub\.com/
